OL,3,GNEWSALennon criticises 'nasty' Scottish
OL,4,ALabour as leadership bid fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Labour MSP Monica Lennon has
OL,7,Fbranded the party "quite nasty" and
OL,8,Faccused it of having "a problem when it
OL,9,Fcomes to trans people" after she failed
OL,10,Fto secure enough nominations to enter
OL,11,Fits leadership race.
OL,13,FMichael Marra and Joe Fagan met the
OL,14,Fthreshold and will now take part in a
OL,15,Fmonth-long contest to replace Anas
OL,16,FSarwar as party leader.
OL,18,FLennon later told BBC Scotland News
OL,19,Fthat the party - which finished joint
OL,20,Fsecond with Reform in the Holyrood
OL,21,Felection - should be showing compassion
OL,22,Fand respect to trans people.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
